{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3143","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3143","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3143\",\"parent_revision\":\"5aff30db799b928d7f2bee3abf52e38ac05cd715bd2e2c095940427c25f58d91\",\"root_revision\":\"5aff30db799b928d7f2bee3abf52e38ac05cd715bd2e2c095940427c25f58d91\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-22\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nTwo development-harness agents advertise one interface in their `description` and forbid it in their body, so a caller that reads the description and dispatches accordingly hands the agent an input it is instructed not to use.\\n\\n`dh-context-gathering`'s description says: \\\"ALWAYS provide the task file path so the agent can read it and update it directly with the context manifest.\\\" `context-refinement`'s description says: \\\"Provide the task file path.\\\" Both descriptions tell the caller the agent will read and write that file directly.\\n\\nBoth bodies then route all task reads and writes through `sam_plan` / `sam_task` and forbid `Edit` or `Write` on the task file \u2014 which is correct and matches this plugin's stated rule that plans and tasks are logical backend records addressed logically, never by filesystem path. The descriptions are the part that is wrong.\\n\\nObserved while surveying agent definitions on 2026-08-22.\\n\\nImpact: an orchestrator selecting an agent by its description constructs a dispatch built on a false contract. The agent then either ignores the supplied path or reports a conflict, and in a worktree-isolated dispatch a path-based handoff resolves to nothing at all rather than erroring. The mismatch is systemic rather than a one-off typo \u2014 both agents share a template ancestry, so other agents derived from the same template may carry it too.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **dh-context-gathering and context-refinement descriptions promise direct task-file access their bodies forbid** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation \u2014 agent definition survey, 2026-08-22\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-22\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"7b3223546fd633ae1cdf28fcbfc6d155c8d86950056c128ce148e5bc5e8221ee\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABQLLfOw\"}"}